<div class="mandarin-hanzi">问</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">wèn</div>

''Meaning:'' ask; inquire  
''Part of speech:'' verb

!! In context
我想问老师一个问题。 — Wǒ xiǎng wèn lǎoshī yí ge wèntí. — I want to ask the teacher a question.

!! Usage note
Can take an addressee and an inquiry, as in 问老师一个问题 (wèn lǎoshī yí ge wèntí, 'ask the teacher a question').
